      "content": "that sounds pretty good. but i'm a bit worried about how the business owners are gonna react when they read this. it feels like the part about the benefits is way more detailed and \"exciting\" than the part about their concerns. could we add a section that really dives into the economic risks? like, maybe explain why people think this is basically just a regressive tax on working families and small shops? i want to make sure the newsletter doesn't look like it's just pushing the city's agenda.",
